 ;; with its GGUF type word, because ADR-0222 stage A item 3 is about the
 ;; type word: `sign_values` is type 9 (array) of element type 5 (INT32) and
 ;; holds -1. `qwen35-gguf-kv-scan.kotoba` today classes int32 arrays as
